OL,3,A'Slim chance' government will hit 1.5m
OL,4,Anew homes target, Rayner tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FData up to June this year suggested the
OL,7,Fgovernment was behind on the rate of
OL,8,Fconstruction needed to meet the goal,
OL,9,Fwhich housebuilders have previously
OL,10,Fwarned was too optimistic.
